 "remarks": "Tres chic! Exquisitely furnished townhouse in convenient Newfield location. Discerning owners have beautifully renovated this unit for modern living. Kitchen has two large sinks, gorgeous marble backsplash and high-end appliances, including a super fast induction cook-top. Bathrooms have been redesigned to the same standards. High-tech mirrors with LED lighting, heat to clear steam function and blue-tooth music. Loads of natural light fill each room. And bonus, there's even a semi-private backyard area. Just steps away from shopping, bus line and houses of worship. One-car garage plus assigned outdoor parking spot. Plenty of closets and storage within unit.",
